        <profile name="Hood of Hellfire (Psychic)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="6d80-d11e-231d-1014">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against psychic attacks and mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="af75-67b0-4fcb-d9e8">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can be attached to the following units:

■ Assault Intercessor Squad
■ Bladeguard Veteran Squad
■ Desolation Squad
■ Intercessor Squad
■ Sternguard Veteran Squad</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Chief Librarian (psyker level 3)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="df6d-c363-ba94-5f75">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model has the psychic abilities listed in the Psychic Abilities section (see left).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Prescience (psychic level 2)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="ae85-480f-e09e-8cf9">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Movement phase, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:
■ On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.
■ This unit has +1 Sv until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Telepathic Assault (psychic level 1)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="1537-0d55-0a32-df4a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:
■ On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.
■ Select one visible enemy unit within 24&quot; of this unit. That enemy unit suffers 2D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
